{
 "id": "conversation_topic_tracking",
 "version": "1.2.2",
 "depends_on": [
  "conversation_topic_route"
 ],
 "description": "Graph-native TOPIC TRACKING for LLM-like conversation: after route_question_to_topic answers about a topic X, the adapter mechanically records X as the conversation's current topic (agent -current_topic-> CurrentTopic{name:X}). These rules then RESOLVE follow-ups against that tracked topic -- the DECISION is graph-native, not Python. (1) resolve_anaphor_to_current_topic: a follow-up whose topic reference is a bare pronoun/possessive ('tell me more about IT', 'how big is it', 'what about ITS mass') carries comp_anaphor=1.0 (written by world_adapter._topic_facts); this rule mints Goal{kind:answer_topic, concept:<current_topic.name>} -- resolving `it`/`that`/`they` to the tracked topic. (2) resolve_elliptical_shift_to_topic: a verbless elliptical topic fragment ('and the three body problem?', 'what about volcanoes?') carries comp_topic + topic_followup=1.0; this rule shifts to the new topic, minting Goal{kind:answer_topic, concept:<comp_topic>}, except when the graph has classified the message as an instruction. This prevents action clauses from becoming answer-topic requests merely because their object resembles a topic. BOTH are gated on already being in a topic conversation (they JOIN on agent -current_topic-> ct, so with no tracked topic no follow-up fires and the honest path handles the turn). Both are single-anchor on agent -received-> m (the sd 'agent observed obs' pattern, never ['agent','is_a','Agent']) JOINed to the current-topic hub; comprehended=1.0 is the mint-once fixpoint guard. The adapter renders the minted goal via _answer_topic_reply (self-heal on a miss), and updates the current topic to the answered concept. ELABORATION PRECEDENCE (v1.1): resolve_anaphor_to_current_topic carries a guard that DEFERS a continuation follow-up ('tell me more'/'elaborate'/'go on' -- a has_mention resolving to a continuation-cue Concept) to the conversation_elaborate seed's progressive-disclosure rules, but ONLY when detail chunks have already been ingested for the current topic (a DetailChunk with topic == ct.name exists). With no detail ingested, a continuation follow-up still resolves to the summary re-answer here, unchanged; a plain anaphor with no cue ('how big is it') is never deferred.",
 "nodes": [],
 "edges": [],
 "productions": [],
 "rules": [
  {
   "name": "resolve_anaphor_to_current_topic",
   "match": [
    [
     "agent",
     "received",
     "m"
    ],
    [
     "agent",
     "current_topic",
     "ct"
    ]
   ],
   "where": {
    "type": "And",
    "items": [
     {
      "type": "Not",
      "arg": {
       "type": "Exists",
       "source": {"type": "Neighbours", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "m"}, "edge_type": "has_interpretation"},
       "var_name": "partial_i",
       "predicate": {"type": "Eq", "a": {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "partial_i"}, "key": "literal_form"}, "b": {"type": "Lit", "value": "fragment"}}
      }
     },
     {
      "type": "Eq",
      "a": {
       "type": "Attr",
       "node": {
        "type": "Var",
        "name": "m"
       },
       "key": "comp_anaphor"
      },
     "b": {
      "type": "Lit",
      "value": 1.0
     }
    },
     {
      "type": "Not",
      "arg": {
       "type": "Eq",
       "a": {
        "type": "Attr",
        "node": {
         "type": "Var",
         "name": "m"
        },
        "key": "comprehended"
       },
       "b": {
        "type": "Lit",
        "value": 1.0
       }
      }
     },
     {
      "type": "Not",
      "arg": {
       "type": "And",
       "items": [
        {
         "type": "Exists",
         "source": {
          "type": "Neighbours",
          "node": {
           "type": "Var",
           "name": "m"
          },
          "edge_type": "has_mention"
         },
         "var_name": "mn_cue",
         "predicate": {
          "type": "In",
          "member": {
           "type": "Attr",
           "node": {
            "type": "Var",
            "name": "mn_cue"
           },
           "key": "text"
          },
          "container": {
           "type": "Lit",
           "value": [
            "more",
            "elaborate",
            "continue",
            "further",
            "else",
            "expand"
           ]
          }
         }
        },
        {
         "type": "Exists",
         "source": {
          "type": "NodesOfType",
          "node_type": "DetailChunk"
         },
         "var_name": "dc_cur",
         "predicate": {
          "type": "Eq",
          "a": {
           "type": "Attr",
           "node": {
            "type": "Var",
            "name": "dc_cur"
           },
           "key": "topic"
          },
          "b": {
           "type": "Attr",
           "node": {
            "type": "Var",
            "name": "ct"
           },
           "key": "name"
          }
         }
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    ]
   },
   "effects": [
    [
     "set_attr",
     "m",
     "comprehended",
     1.0
    ],
    [
     "add_node",
     "g",
     "Goal",
     {
      "kind": "answer_topic",
      "status": "active",
      "source": "conversation",
      "concept": {
       "__term__": {
        "type": "Attr",
        "node": {
         "type": "Var",
         "name": "ct"
        },
        "key": "name"
       }
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     "add_edge",
     "agent",
     "has_goal",
     "g"
    ],
    [
     "add_edge",
     "g",
     "comprehends",
     "m"
    ],
    [
     "add_edge",
     "m",
     "comprehended_by",
     "g"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "name": "resolve_elliptical_shift_to_topic",
   "match": [
    [
     "agent",
     "received",
     "m"
    ],
    [
     "agent",
     "current_topic",
     "ct"
    ]
   ],
   "where": {
   "type": "And",
   "items": [
    {
     "type": "Not",
     "arg": {
      "type": "Exists",
      "source": {"type": "Neighbours", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "m"}, "edge_type": "has_interpretation"},
      "var_name": "partial_i",
      "predicate": {"type": "Eq", "a": {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "partial_i"}, "key": "literal_form"}, "b": {"type": "Lit", "value": "fragment"}}
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "Eq",
      "a": {
       "type": "Attr",
       "node": {
        "type": "Var",
        "name": "m"
       },
       "key": "topic_followup"
      },
      "b": {
       "type": "Lit",
       "value": 1.0
      }
     },
    {
     "type": "Not",
     "arg": {
      "type": "Eq",
      "a": {
       "type": "Attr",
       "node": {
        "type": "Var",
        "name": "m"
       },
       "key": "comp_kind"
      },
      "b": {
       "type": "Lit",
       "value": "instruction"
      }
     }
    },
     {
      "type": "Not",
      "arg": {
       "type": "Eq",
       "a": {
        "type": "Attr",
        "node": {
         "type": "Var",
         "name": "m"
        },
        "key": "comprehended"
       },
       "b": {
        "type": "Lit",
        "value": 1.0
       }
      }
     }
    ]
   },
   "effects": [
    [
     "set_attr",
     "m",
     "comprehended",
     1.0
    ],
    [
     "add_node",
     "g",
     "Goal",
     {
      "kind": "answer_topic",
      "status": "active",
      "source": "conversation",
      "concept": {
       "__term__": {
        "type": "Attr",
        "node": {
         "type": "Var",
         "name": "m"
        },
        "key": "comp_topic"
       }
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     "add_edge",
     "agent",
     "has_goal",
     "g"
    ],
    [
     "add_edge",
     "g",
     "comprehends",
     "m"
    ],
    [
     "add_edge",
     "m",
     "comprehended_by",
     "g"
    ]
   ]
  }
 ]
}
